TC-08 manual evidence — Parking observations and uncertainty
Date: 2026-09-17

Administrator: phase2.manual-admin@fithub.test
Route: /simulation/parking
Camera: SIM-PARK-CAMERA-01
Spaces: P-A1..P-A4, P-B1..P-B4, P-C1..P-C4

Observed:
- Connected Mode reported API verified and ParkingHub connected.
- Baseline Scan Now persisted 12 observations at 0.98 confidence; all 12 simulation spaces were Available.
- The Member parking page received the persisted values and displayed them without a manual data edit.
- Camera Offline followed by Scan Now persisted all 12 monitored spaces as Unknown and logged CAMERA_OFFLINE.
- Camera Online with low-confidence/obstructed view kept all 12 as Unknown and stated that confidence was below threshold instead of guessing.
- Clearing low confidence and scanning restored all 12 simulation spaces to Available at 0.98 confidence.
- PostgreSQL source for all 12 was SIM-PARK-CAMERA-01.
- The Member overview contained 15 total records because three pre-existing seed spaces (A-01, A-02, B-01) coexist with the 12 simulation spaces.

Decision: PASS for FR-29 and FR-30.
Limitation: the two-space vehicle alert scenario was not repeated during this evidence pass; connected persistence, uncertainty and Member visibility were executed.
